atom_style granular
atom_modify map array
boundary f f f
newton off
communicate single vel yes
units si
region dom block -0.05 0.10 -0.004 0.004 -0.001 0.004 units box
create_box 1 dom
neighbor 0.0002 bin
neigh_modify delay 0
fix p1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 100000000.0
fix p2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.3
fix p3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix p4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.5
fix p5 all property/global coefficientRollingFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.1
fix p6 all property/global coefficientRollingViscousDamping peratomtypepair 1 0.1
fix p7 all property/global coeffRollingStiffness peratomtypepair 1 1.0
fix p8 all property/global rollingStiffness scalar 2.25
pair_style gran model hertz tangential history rolling_friction cdt
pair_coeff * *
fix w all wall/gran model hertz tangential history rolling_friction cdt primitive type 1 zplane 0.0
create_atoms 1 single 0 0 0.00099989999999999996 units box
set atom * diameter 0.002 density 2500.0
fix gravi all gravity 9.81 vector 0 0 -1
timestep 2e-06
fix integr all nve/sphere 
compute om all property/atom omegay
compute oms all reduce sum c_om
variable vx1 equal vx[1]
thermo_style custom step v_vx1 c_oms
thermo_modify format float %.17g norm no
thermo 1000
run 20000
velocity all set 0.070000000000000007 0 0 units box
run 53516
